       }
      ],
      "text": "A norm QTc doesn't exclude it:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " found in 25 to 50% of gene-positive cases; @ the moment of torsades, though, the QTc = essentially always prolonged"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
