      "text": " QTc ≥ 480 ms 3; QTc 460–479 ms 2; QTc 450–459 ms (males only) 1; QTc ≥ 480 ms in the 4th min of exercise recovery 1; torsades 2; T-wave alternans 1; notched T wave in 3 leads 1; resting HR < 2nd percentile for age 0.5"
     }
    ]
   },
